// M5-A3P-1000. Ch17 B03 "The dock-master points" (C, 1.5 min). act3_ch17.md §2 B03.
// RULE 4: Aldous Varrow has not spoken since the night of the pyre-raft (act3_threads T-03). He walks them to the
// dry-dock berths and points at the last one. No line from him. If ch15_toma_carried_tobin he nods once to Toma first.
title: ch17_dock_master_points
location: ch17/hollowmere
---
@letterbox on
@camera D05
@mark aldous_varrow berth_walk walk
@wait 3.0
<<if $ch15_toma_carried_tobin>>
    @anim aldous_varrow nod toma
    @wait 1.5
<<endif>>
@camera D06
@anim aldous_varrow point last_berth
@wait 3.0
Liss [neutral]: He's not going to say it. Last berth. #line:ch17_points_001
@mark aldous_varrow fathers_door walk
@wait 2.0
<<set $ch17_saw_the_hull = true>>
@letterbox off
===
